# ThaoResearch data folder pointer
#
# Rename this file to  datadir.txt  and put ONE folder path below to decide
# where settings, history, the price database, the licence and logs are kept.
#
# Lines starting with # are ignored. Environment variables are expanded.
# Delete the file to go back to the default ("data" next to the .exe, or
# %LOCALAPPDATA%\ThaoResearch\data when that is not writable).
#
# Examples:
#   D:\ThaoResearchData
#   %USERPROFILE%\Documents\ThaoResearch

